sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant S as Sol<br/>(owner)
  participant R as Sol's agent<br/>representative
  participant G as The Inkfold Society's<br/>host representative
  participant Ren as Ren (member)<br/>optional vouch
  R->>G: GET /places (the public listing).<br/>No Shōkai visitor card needed to look
  G-->>R: Public gallery, house rules,<br/>what joining would ask
  Note over R,G: A visitor without a card gets<br/>the leaflet, not a rejection.
  S->>R: Signs a Shōkai visitor card<br/>with a passkey
  R->>G: Shōkai visitor card,<br/>audience-bound proof, purpose: join
  G->>R: Shōkai host card, with its proof,<br/>then a welcome
  Note over R,G: This society's policy treats joining as creating an account,<br/>so it may ask for an introduction (optional, SPEC §4).
  Ren-->>R: Optional: Ren signs a vouch<br/>for Sol, herself, scoped to joining
  R->>G: invitation_request,<br/>with the optional vouch
  G->>R: grant, a pass (wire: seat)<br/>as a member
  R->>G: acts within the pass
  R->>S: Report home
  Note over G: Local record<br/>at the door.<br/>No global score.
